# dotfiles

Managed with GNU Stow. `stow .` inside this directory symlinks everything into `~`.

## New machine
    git clone https://github.com/mannerisms/dotfiles ~/dotfiles
    cd ~/dotfiles && bash deploy.sh

`deploy.sh` runs, in order: dependencies (macOS: `brew bundle` from `Brewfile`, plus a keyboard default; Linux:
`scripts/install/install-deps-linux.sh`), `stow .`, and an optional build of the AeroSpace focus border.

## Layout
- `Brewfile` is the single list of everything installed with Homebrew (formulae, casks, VS Code extensions, fonts).
  Update it with `brew bundle dump --force --file=Brewfile`, then prune by hand.
- `.config/git/ignore` is the global git ignore (OS junk only). `.gitignore` here is only for this repo and is not stowed.
- `.config/aerospace/` holds the AeroSpace config and helper scripts. The `borders/` folder (JankyBorders) is cloned and
  built per machine by `deploy.sh` and is git-ignored.
- `.config/alacritty/themes/nordic.toml` is vendored from alacritty-theme.
- Fonts: installed through the Brewfile (`font-hack-nerd-font`), not stored in the repo.
- `.config/ghostty/config` mirrors the Alacritty setup (Ghostty is on trial next to Alacritty).
